{
    "title": "Universal TV Remote Control",
    "description": "Introducing the ultimate solution for your TV viewing needs - a free Universal TV Remote Control app that is more than just a smart TV remote control. With this app, you can easily control universal TV and cast all your web or local media onto your TV as well, making it an all-in-one TV control and casting app. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25<b>Compatibility with All Major Android TV remote Brands:</b>\r\nOne of the standout features of Universal TV Remote is its compatibility with all major TV brands, including LG TV control, Samsung TV control, Sony TV control, Roku TV control, Toshiba TV control, etc. This means that regardless of what brand of TV you have, this Universal TV Remote app will work seamlessly with your device, making it an incredibly versatile option for any household.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25<b>Voice Search Function:</b>\r\nIn addition to providing wireless WiFi control universal TV, this Universal TV Remote Control takes things a step further by including a voice search function. No more scrolling aimlessly through channels or apps - simply speak into your phone and let the app do the rest! The interface is user-friendly and easy to navigate, meaning you'll be able to find exactly what you're looking for in no time at all.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25<b>Screen Mirroring and  TV Cast </b>:\r\nThis Universal TV Remote Control also offers screen mirroring and casting capabilities that allow you to easily cast all your web or local media onto your TV. You can mirror anyview cast local media to your TV, or cast online web video, picture, audio,making it simple to enjoy all your favorite content on the big screen.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25<b>Access to Popular Channels:</b>\r\nYou can use Universal TV Remote to access popular channels like Netflix, YouTube, Prime, Hulu, Spectrum, Disney, and many more. The ultra-smooth navigation touchpad ensures that controlling your viewing experience is a breeze.\r\n\r\nIn short, this Universal TV Remote Control app is a must-have for anyone looking to streamline their TV viewing experience. With its wide range of features and compatibility with all major TV brands, it's the perfect way to take control of your entertainment options. \r\nSo why wait? Download this Universal TV Remote Control today and start enjoying your favorite shows and movies like never before!\r\n\r\n\u2763\ufe0f<b>Disclaimer of Universal TV Remote Control</b>\r\nIt's important to note that this Universal TV Remote Control app is an unofficial product and is not affiliated with or endorsed by any TV brand. Additionally, you'll need to ensure that your TV and mobile phone are on the same WiFi network to use the wireless connection features.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Introducing the ultimate solution for your TV viewing needs - a free Universal TV Remote Control app that is more than just a smart TV remote control. With this app, you can easily control universal TV and cast all your web or local media onto your TV as well, making it an all-in-one TV control and casting app. <br><br>\ud83d\udd25<b>Compatibility with All Major Android TV remote Brands:</b><br>One of the standout features of Universal TV Remote is its compatibility with all major TV brands, including LG TV control, Samsung TV control, Sony TV control, Roku TV control, Toshiba TV control, etc. This means that regardless of what brand of TV you have, this Universal TV Remote app will work seamlessly with your device, making it an incredibly versatile option for any household.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25<b>Voice Search Function:</b><br>In addition to providing wireless WiFi control universal TV, this Universal TV Remote Control takes things a step further by including a voice search function. No more scrolling aimlessly through channels or apps - simply speak into your phone and let the app do the rest! The interface is user-friendly and easy to navigate, meaning you&#39;ll be able to find exactly what you&#39;re looking for in no time at all.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25<b>Screen Mirroring and  TV Cast </b>:<br>This Universal TV Remote Control also offers screen mirroring and casting capabilities that allow you to easily cast all your web or local media onto your TV. You can mirror anyview cast local media to your TV, or cast online web video, picture, audio,making it simple to enjoy all your favorite content on the big screen.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25<b>Access to Popular Channels:</b><br>You can use Universal TV Remote to access popular channels like Netflix, YouTube, Prime, Hulu, Spectrum, Disney, and many more. The ultra-smooth navigation touchpad ensures that controlling your viewing experience is a breeze.<br><br>In short, this Universal TV Remote Control app 